🎓 Ralph Loop Workflow (Baar Baar Follow Karo)
Step 1: Pehle Decide Karo — Kya Banana Hai?
Har baar ek hi feature rakho. Abhi humara target hai:

"Dashboard ko improve karna"

Step 2: 

PRD.md
 Update Karo (Main File)
Yahi sabse zaroori file hai jo Ralph padh kar kaam karta hai. Isme crystal clear likho ki Dashboard mein kya-kya dikhna chahiye, jaise:

Kaun se cards ho (Total Employees, Present Today, Absent, On Leave)
Koi chart ho (Attendance Graph)
Koi quick action buttons ho
Step 3: 

prompt.md
 Update Karo (Instructions)
Isme Ralph ko batao ki woh kaise kaam kare — kaunsi files chhedni hain, kaunsi nahi.

Step 4: Ralph Loop Start Karo
VS Code mein Ralph Loop panel mein jaao aur Play (▶️) button dabao. Woh naya git branch banayega aur designer + coder ki tarah kaam shuru kar dega.

Step 5: CodeRabbit Review
Jab Ralph ruk jaaye, CodeRabbit bata dega ki kya theek karna baaki hai. Jo issues aayein, aap mujhe bhejna — main fix kar dunga.

Step 6: Merge
Sab theek hone par Git mein branch ko main mein merge karo. Feature live!

Aab seedha kaam shuru karte hain!

Aap mujhe bataiye — Dashboard mein aapko exactly kya kya dikhna chahiye? Kuch examples:

📊 Aaj kitne employee present hain?
💰 Is mahine ki total salary kitni hogi?
🏖️ Kaun leave par hai?
📈 Attendance ka weekly graph?
Jitna batayenge, main utna accha 

PRD.md
 likh dunga aur Ralph ko seedha kaam pe laga denge! 🚀